  "changelog": "**🆕 MudaFork v6.0.0**\n\nFirst release of MudaFork, a fork of MudaRemote (MIT).\n\n### 🆕 What the fork adds\n- **Side rolls and gives:** extra roll and give handling on top of the original bot.\n- **Perk 10 upgrade:** automatic perk-10 upgrade (games first, final stock, minimum 2000).\n- **Fast setup:** a shorter first-run setup.\n- **Logs:** one log line shape with kinds and redaction, daily TXT files, filters and export.\n- **Keep running:** the Android app keeps the bot running on phones that kill background apps.\n\n### 🔁 Updates\n- Updates now come only from the MudaFork releases on GitHub. The Android app installs next to MudaRemote under its own app id (`com.mudafork.android`).\n\nRestart the bot after updating.",
